      "height": 90,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Two paths, one index. Code arrives from CI as a signed bundle, is stored in object storage, and the worker turns it into a searchable index.\nQuestions arrive from an editor or a terminal and are answered from that same index — filtered in SQL by what the person asking is allowed to read.",
      "originalText": "Two paths, one index. Code arrives from CI as a signed bundle, is stored in object storage, and the worker turns it into a searchable index.\nQuestions arrive from an editor or a terminal and are answered from that same index — filtered in SQL by what the person asking is allowed to read.",
